  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x10D4" flags="0x0">
    <title>TPS - In Gear | Cyl 2 | Blend Map (inactive)</title>
    <description>Secondary TPS fuel map for cylinder 2.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_453B8 blends this map into the main map with a weight computed as clamp(0, 0..1024) = 0 (enable word 0x18262A is non-zero but the weight source is a constant 0), so in the stock code this map has no effect. Was "TPS - Mode B | Gear 2" in the DanCycles naming.

AXES: X axis: 26 points, 0.46 to 118 deg (abs. TP angle); Y axis: 50 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock 5JCZSJ40): 454 to 5132 raw (inj. time?).

TUNING NOTES: Editing this map does nothing on the stock code path.

