  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x10E5" flags="0x0">
    <title>TPS - Neutral/Clutch-In | Cyl 1</title>
    <description>TPS base fuel map for cylinder 1 used while in NEUTRAL or with the CLUTCH PULLED (free-revving, blips, warm-up idle).

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_454DA uses this map when flag 0xFEF0271D bit0 (gear = neutral OR clutch switch on) has been set for at least 3 cycles (counter &gt;= 0x182703 = 3) and option 0x1826E8 != 3; otherwise it passes the in-gear result through.

AXES: X axis: 26 points, 0.46 to 118 deg (abs. TP angle); Y axis: 50 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock 5JCZSJ40): 467 to 5351 raw (inj. time?).

TUNING NOTES: Tune for idle quality and free-rev response. Has no effect when riding in gear with the clutch out.

CONFIDENCE: Confirmed from code.

REFERENCE: data @0x17ECA8, X axis @0x156B24, Y axis @0x17EC44, descriptor @0x156B58, code FUN_454da.</description>
