    <description>Traction-control derivative term for TC level 5: torque cut vs how fast the slip error is changing.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_4DDFC looks this up with RAM 0xFEF0135C (moving-average change of slip, 0x8000 = steady, from FUN_4CD6A). Used instead of the next curve depending on flags 0xFEF013A8 bit7 / 0xFEF013A9 bit0.

