  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1250" flags="0x0">
    <title>ETV - Slot 4 | Neutral (unused stock)</title>
    <description>Throttle-by-wire target map in slot 4 of the 6-slot ETV table, neutral.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: Same lookup as the PWR maps (FUN_7C4CE, pointer table 0x1AD7A4[gear*6+slot]). The stock per-gear selector bytes 0x18F13A-0x18F155 only ever choose slots 1-3, so slots 4-6 are never selected in this calibration (they may be reserved for another market/model or launch logic).

AXES: X axis: 23 points, 0.00 to 118 deg (abs. accel angle); Y axis: 39 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock 5JCZSJ40): 0.00 to 119 throttle angle (deg).

TUNING NOTES: No effect unless a selector byte at 0x18F13A-0x18F155 is changed to 3/4/5 (zero-based slot). Could be used as a custom throttle map by editing the selector - untested.

CONFIDENCE: Confirmed from the pointer table and selector bytes. Was "ETV - 1".

REFERENCE: data @0x19A5D0, X axis @0x1901CC, Y axis @0x19A580, descriptor @0x18F590, code FUN_7c4ce.</description>
