  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x1269" flags="0x0">
    <title>TC - Throttle Limit | Neutral &amp; 1st</title>
    <description>Traction-control THROTTLE limit for Neutral &amp; 1st gear: maximum throttle-valve angle (grip angle x RPM) while TC is cutting.

HOW THE ECU USES IT: FUN_7C5A2 looks it up via gear-indexed table 0x18FD28; FUN_7C944 applies min(this, normal throttle target) when ETV state 0xFEF02AF2 = 2, which FUN_7C8F4 sets from the TC-active flag (0xFEF01349 bit3).

AXES: X axis: 23 points, 0.00 to 121 deg (abs. accel angle); Y axis: 39 points, 800 to 16000 RPM.

VALUES (stock 5JCZSJ40): 0.00 to 44.2 throttle angle (deg).

TUNING NOTES: Lower cells = TC closes the throttle further during intervention. Was "ETV 2 - n".

