<XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9001" flags="0x0"><title>Ride Mode A | Power mode (PW 1-3)</title><description>Factory preset for ride mode A, loaded by FUN_6D57A into the active-mode settings (PW -&gt; 0xFEF026D2, TC -&gt; 0xFEF026D4, field 3 -&gt; 0xFEF026D5, field 4 -&gt; 0xFEF026D6, LF -&gt; 0xFEF026D7, field 6 -&gt; 0xFEF026D8). Modes U1-U3 take these values from the rider settings in RAM instead. Stock A = 1,1,0,0,1,1,0; B = 2,5,0,0,5,1,0; C = 3,10,0,0,10,2,0. PW and TC/LF roles confirmed by which code reads them; fields 3/4/6/7 not yet traced.</description><CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="48" /><EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x18F120" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" /><units /><decimalpl>0</decimalpl><datatype>0</datatype><unittype>0</unittype><DALINK index="0" /><MATH equation="X"><VAR id="X" /></MATH></XDFCONSTANT><XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9002" flags="0x0"><title>Ride Mode A | TC level (1-10)</title><description>Factory preset for ride mode A, loaded by FUN_6D57A into the active-mode settings (PW -&gt; 0xFEF026D2, TC -&gt; 0xFEF026D4, field 3 -&gt; 0xFEF026D5, field 4 -&gt; 0xFEF026D6, LF -&gt; 0xFEF026D7, field 6 -&gt; 0xFEF026D8). Modes U1-U3 take these values from the rider settings in RAM instead. Stock A = 1,1,0,0,1,1,0; B = 2,5,0,0,5,1,0; C = 3,10,0,0,10,2,0. PW and TC/LF roles confirmed by which code reads them; fields 3/4/6/7 not yet traced.</description><CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="48" /><EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x18F121" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" /><units /><decimalpl>0</decimalpl><datatype>0</datatype><unittype>0</unittype><DALINK index="0" /><MATH equation="X"><VAR id="X" /></MATH></XDFCONSTANT><XDFCONSTANT uniqueid="0x9003" flags="0x0"><title>Ride Mode A | Field 3 (unconfirmed)</title><description>Factory preset for ride mode A, loaded by FUN_6D57A into the active-mode settings (PW -&gt; 0xFEF026D2, TC -&gt; 0xFEF026D4, fie